1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:01,824
Today,

2
00:00:01,824 --> 00:00:03,936
Beelu and his mom and dad

3
00:00:03,936 --> 00:00:08,352
go exploring in the mountains together.

4
00:00:08,352 --> 00:00:09,744
We're here!

5
00:00:09,744 --> 00:00:10,560
Whoa!

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,624
It's beautiful!

7
00:00:12,624 --> 00:00:14,880
The scenery here is breathtaking.

8
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:18,960
Hikers pass down stories of this hidden paradise.

9
00:00:19,925 --> 00:00:21,456
Beelu notices

10
00:00:21,456 --> 00:00:25,200
a wooden sign covered in vines.

11
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,504
It seems to have some kind of picture on it.

12
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,525
Dad, what's this?

13
00:00:30,525 --> 00:00:32,425
Oh, let me take a look.

14
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:37,550
Huh?

15
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:41,992
Suddenly, the stone slab beneath Beelu's feet opens up,

16
00:00:41,992 --> 00:00:45,112
and he falls into a huge pit!

17
00:00:45,112 --> 00:00:50,344
Aaaaaah!

18
00:00:55,050 --> 00:00:56,680
Hey!

19
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:58,504
Just as he is about to hit the ground,

20
00:00:58,504 --> 00:01:00,616
a strip of cloth comes flying over

21
00:01:00,616 --> 00:01:02,440
and wraps around Beelu.

22
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:06,325
I can't let you ruin all the hard work everyone put in!

23
00:01:06,325 --> 00:01:07,864
Thank you!

24
00:01:07,864 --> 00:01:09,784
That scared me half to death!

25
00:01:11,896 --> 00:01:13,720
Little Cloth reports to the elder

26
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:17,944
that Beelu fell through the secret entrance.

27
00:01:19,312 --> 00:01:21,520
I see.

28
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:23,200
We'll send someone

29
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:25,312
to help look for your parents

30
00:01:25,312 --> 00:01:27,808
and let them know what happened.

31
00:01:27,808 --> 00:01:29,920
The mountain paths are dangerous,

32
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:32,080
so stay here for now.

33
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:33,808
The people of the tribe

34
00:01:33,808 --> 00:01:37,696
are busy preparing for the Harvest Festival and coming-of-age ceremony.

35
00:01:37,696 --> 00:01:39,725
They have a lot to do.

36
00:01:39,725 --> 00:01:40,875
How about

37
00:01:40,875 --> 00:01:45,424
joining the festival?

38
00:01:45,424 --> 00:01:46,125
Okay!

39
00:01:47,104 --> 00:01:49,696
That night,

40
00:01:49,696 --> 00:01:51,280
Beelu and everyone

41
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:53,728
compete in games together,

42
00:01:53,728 --> 00:01:55,936
eat together,

43
00:01:55,936 --> 00:01:58,624
and dance together.

44
00:01:58,624 --> 00:02:00,875
At the festival, Beelu

45
00:02:00,875 --> 00:02:03,616
makes lots of new friends.

46
00:02:03,616 --> 00:02:05,248
He also witnesses Little Cloth

47
00:02:05,248 --> 00:02:08,752
complete the coming-of-age ceremony

48
00:02:08,752 --> 00:02:11,104
and earn the tribe's recognition

49
00:02:11,104 --> 00:02:13,168
as an adult.

50
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:15,400
Phew.

51
00:02:16,850 --> 00:02:18,496
Whoa!

52
00:02:18,496 --> 00:02:23,152
Suddenly, someone gives Beelu a lick!

53
00:02:23,152 --> 00:02:24,832
For us weasels,

54
00:02:24,832 --> 00:02:27,904
grooming one another is a sign of friendship!

55
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:31,216
I'm not used to that.

56
00:02:31,216 --> 00:02:32,704
Maybe not right now.

57
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,696
The festival is over.

58
00:02:43,696 --> 00:02:46,288
Beelu lies in bed

59
00:02:46,288 --> 00:02:48,496
getting ready to sleep.

60
00:02:48,496 --> 00:02:49,888
Hey, outsider.

61
00:02:51,952 --> 00:02:54,928
Oh, thanks for this morning.

62
00:02:54,928 --> 00:02:56,128
You're welcome.

63
00:02:56,128 --> 00:02:58,192
Helping others is an adult's duty.

64
00:02:58,192 --> 00:02:59,392
Tomorrow, could you ask for me by name

65
00:02:59,392 --> 00:03:01,120
to escort you out of the village?

66
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:01,936
Sure!

67
00:03:01,936 --> 00:03:03,280
Thanks in advance.

68
00:03:04,576 --> 00:03:05,125
Heh-heh.

69
00:03:05,125 --> 00:03:05,875
Great!

70
00:03:05,875 --> 00:03:06,547
That way,

71
00:03:06,547 --> 00:03:08,575
I can get out of tomorrow's Grooming Festival!

72
00:03:09,300 --> 00:03:11,100
The Grooming Festival

73
00:03:11,100 --> 00:03:15,119
is an event where weasels gather to groom one another.

74
00:03:15,119 --> 00:03:16,079
However,

75
00:03:16,079 --> 00:03:19,967
Little Cloth hates being touched.

76
00:03:20,850 --> 00:03:23,034
If you don't like being groomed,

77
00:03:23,034 --> 00:03:25,914
why not just say no?

78
00:03:25,914 --> 00:03:26,874
Hmm.

79
00:03:26,874 --> 00:03:28,554
That would be more straightforward.

80
00:03:28,554 --> 00:03:29,274
Besides,

81
00:03:29,274 --> 00:03:31,290
I could just wrap myself in cloth again.

82
00:03:31,290 --> 00:03:33,306
Then no one could touch me.

83
00:03:33,306 --> 00:03:34,602
Oh.

84
00:03:36,250 --> 00:03:39,034
See you tomorrow, then!

85
00:03:40,314 --> 00:03:41,418
Late that night,

86
00:03:41,418 --> 00:03:45,162
the stars sparkle in the sky.

87
00:03:45,162 --> 00:03:49,325
Beelu thinks about what happened earlier.

88
00:03:49,325 --> 00:03:51,450
As he keeps thinking,

89
00:03:51,450 --> 00:03:53,322
he drifts off to sleep.

90
00:03:56,490 --> 00:03:57,738
The next day,

91
00:03:57,738 --> 00:03:59,370
Beelu and Little Cloth

92
00:03:59,370 --> 00:04:01,434
set off together to leave the village.

93
00:04:01,434 --> 00:04:03,642
They make their way through the jungle,

94
00:04:06,618 --> 00:04:08,490
cross a river,

95
00:04:10,842 --> 00:04:12,618
and climb over rocks.

96
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,082
At last,

97
00:04:17,082 --> 00:04:21,738
Beelu and Little Cloth reach a cliff.

98
00:04:21,738 --> 00:04:23,418
We're almost there. Just get past this part.

99
00:04:24,330 --> 00:04:26,922
Seeing the towering cliff,

100
00:04:26,922 --> 00:04:28,506
Beelu

101
00:04:28,506 --> 00:04:30,570
feels a little scared.

102
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:36,188
Could you hold my hand while we cross?

103
00:04:36,188 --> 00:04:38,634
Hmm.

104
00:04:38,634 --> 00:04:39,978
Sigh...

105
00:04:39,978 --> 00:04:41,600
We've come this far.

106
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,250
All right.

107
00:04:42,250 --> 00:04:42,970
Come on.

108
00:04:49,250 --> 00:04:51,930
We finally made it!

109
00:04:51,930 --> 00:04:55,723
Beelu feels completely relieved.

110
00:04:55,723 --> 00:04:58,150
After an enormous effort,

111
00:04:58,150 --> 00:05:01,366
they reach a forest trail.

112
00:05:01,366 --> 00:05:03,382
This is where the people from the tribe

113
00:05:03,382 --> 00:05:06,646
arranged to meet Beelu's mom and dad

114
00:05:06,646 --> 00:05:09,670
to pick him up.

115
00:05:09,670 --> 00:05:12,051
Wow! Look, look!

116
00:05:12,051 --> 00:05:13,683
It's a little yellow weasel!

117
00:05:13,683 --> 00:05:14,979
So cute!

118
00:05:14,979 --> 00:05:17,619
What a rare sight!

119
00:05:17,619 --> 00:05:20,115
A group of animals spots Little Cloth

120
00:05:20,115 --> 00:05:21,939
and suddenly rushes over.

121
00:05:21,939 --> 00:05:25,203
They start petting and hugging him,

122
00:05:25,203 --> 00:05:29,283
which frightens Little Cloth.

123
00:05:29,283 --> 00:05:30,435
Stop that!

124
00:05:30,435 --> 00:05:32,691
He doesn't like being touched!

125
00:05:32,691 --> 00:05:33,525
What's the big deal?

126
00:05:33,525 --> 00:05:35,187
He hasn't said anything!

127
00:05:41,859 --> 00:05:42,771
Just then,

128
00:05:42,771 --> 00:05:46,131
Little Cloth remembers what Beelu told him:

129
00:05:46,131 --> 00:05:50,451
if you don't like something, you should bravely say no.

130
00:05:50,451 --> 00:05:51,459
Don't touch me!

131
00:05:51,459 --> 00:05:52,611
I don't like it!

132
00:05:54,275 --> 00:05:56,625
Little Cloth shouts

133
00:05:56,625 --> 00:05:58,987
and pushes their hands away,

134
00:05:58,987 --> 00:06:00,667
stepping back.

135
00:06:00,667 --> 00:06:04,363
The animals are left feeling awkward.

136
00:06:04,363 --> 00:06:05,611
He said no.

137
00:06:05,611 --> 00:06:07,291
Don't pressure him.

138
00:06:08,050 --> 00:06:09,017
At that moment,

139
00:06:09,017 --> 00:06:11,321
Beelu's mom and dad

140
00:06:11,321 --> 00:06:14,153
suddenly appear behind them.

141
00:06:14,153 --> 00:06:16,985
The animals realize they're in the wrong

142
00:06:16,985 --> 00:06:19,817
and quietly shuffle away.

143
00:06:19,817 --> 00:06:23,225
Seeing his parents

144
00:06:23,225 --> 00:06:28,937
after being apart from them for so long

145
00:06:28,937 --> 00:06:31,241
makes Beelu feel safe again.

146
00:06:32,873 --> 00:06:35,897
He even starts to cry.

147
00:06:35,897 --> 00:06:37,433
Dad! Mom!

148
00:06:37,433 --> 00:06:39,593
Beelu, it's okay.

149
00:06:39,593 --> 00:06:40,601
You're all right now.

150
00:06:40,601 --> 00:06:42,809
Little one,

151
00:06:42,809 --> 00:06:44,297
you brought Beelu up here, didn't you?

152
00:06:45,593 --> 00:06:46,985
Thank you.

153
00:06:48,625 --> 00:06:49,625
It was nothing.

154
00:06:49,625 --> 00:06:51,625
No,

155
00:06:51,625 --> 00:06:53,177
thank you so much.

156
00:06:53,177 --> 00:06:55,001
Because you helped me, I was able to make it here.

157
00:06:58,793 --> 00:07:01,097
Little Cloth hesitates for a long time.

158
00:07:01,097 --> 00:07:01,961
At last,

159
00:07:01,961 --> 00:07:04,601
he reaches out his hand.

160
00:07:04,601 --> 00:07:07,865
Don't fall down again next time, okay?

161
00:07:07,865 --> 00:07:08,633
Okay!

162
00:07:08,633 --> 00:07:10,553
Today was so much fun!

163
00:07:13,145 --> 00:07:16,217
Today, Beelu visited Hualien.

164
00:07:16,217 --> 00:07:17,513
He accidentally

165
00:07:17,513 --> 00:07:19,769
fell into a pit.

166
00:07:19,769 --> 00:07:22,409
Luckily, Little Cloth rescued him.

167
00:07:22,409 --> 00:07:23,705
In the story,

168
00:07:23,705 --> 00:07:26,393
Little Cloth didn't like other people grooming him without permission,

169
00:07:26,393 --> 00:07:29,650
and he even disliked being touched.

170
00:07:29,650 --> 00:07:32,633
But he encountered a group of rude animals

171
00:07:32,633 --> 00:07:34,601
who ignored his feelings

172
00:07:34,601 --> 00:07:37,193
and touched him anyway.

173
00:07:37,193 --> 00:07:38,201
Kids,

174
00:07:38,201 --> 00:07:38,921
what do you think?

175
00:07:38,921 --> 00:07:42,473
Is it okay for someone to touch your body without permission?

176
00:07:42,473 --> 00:07:45,737
If something like this happens to you,

177
00:07:45,737 --> 00:07:48,041
what can you do?

178
00:07:48,041 --> 00:07:49,865
The video is over!

179
00:07:49,865 --> 00:07:51,737
Kids,

180
00:07:51,737 --> 00:07:54,761
remember to give your eyes a little rest!
